WEBVTT

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.467
Nihoyat, juda muhim joyga keldik.

00:08:30.491 --> 00:08:32.274
Mutaxassislar uni "sirena" deyishadi.

00:08:32.298 --> 00:08:34.918
Boshida “Vi” bilan boshlanib,
“ou” bilan davom etadi.

00:08:34.942 --> 00:08:36.562
“Vi” baland, “ou” esa past.

00:08:36.586 --> 00:08:42.682
Chiqishda: “vi-i-i-i-ou-u-u-u”,
“vi-i-i-i-ou-u-u-u”.

00:08:42.706 --> 00:08:44.945
Barakalla. O’zingizni olqishlang.

00:08:44.969 --> 00:08:46.214
O’tiring. Rahmat.

00:08:46.238 --> 00:08:47.688
(Qarsaklar)

00:08:47.712 --> 00:08:50.312
Sahnaga chiqishdan oldin
shu mashqlarni qiling.

00:08:50.336 --> 00:08:52.952
Keling, yakun yasab, bugungi
mavzuga aniqlik kiritamiz.

00:08:52.976 --> 00:08:55.248
Bu juda muhim.

00:08:55.272 --> 00:08:57.079
Vaziyat quyidagichadir:

00:08:57.103 --> 00:08:58.744
biz fikrimizni aniq va lo'nda

00:08:58.768 --> 00:09:00.612
tushuntira olmaymiz.